The substantive classification also holds: `scanHappy` is a structurally decreasing, guard-complete recurrence over the string tail, not a configuration rewrite or asserted theorem. Its three equations correspond exactly to empty input, the first two warm-up characters, and each later three-character window. Across 21,845 adversarial sequences—including the `-1` sentinel—both the operational loop and recurrence matched the stated contract; deleting any of the three inequality checks or delaying the guard produced concrete counterexamples.

Producer provenance is intact as well: both source hashes, the exact three-file producer bundle, its whole-tree hash, and image ID all match the generator manifest, source manifest, and audit input. I’m running the required trusted Stage 4 preflight now.
